# Hive mind

Before changing cross-product behavior, read `docs/hive/README.md` and `docs/wip-program/HARD_RULES.md`.

- One money OS (Client Engine), one agent face (OpenClaw), one ops cockpit (Scorpion).
- Keep target repo solo-usable; respect `docs/hive/INTEROP_CONTRACTS.md`.
- HITL for spend, client send, prod deploy, delete data, secrets, `openclaw.json`.
- Never wipe OpenClaw souls/topics or `n8n_data` volumes.
- Never put basic_auth on n8n webhooks or `/claw/hooks*`.
- Prefer execute+verify; do not claim done without checking the live surface.
